{'symbol': 'WM', 'date': '2020-12-09 16:00:00', 'title': "WASTE MANAGEMENT RECOGNIZED WITH PRESTIGIOUS ‘A' SCORE FOR CLIMATE LEADERSHIP", 'text': "HOUSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $WM--WASTE MANAGEMENT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED FOR LEADERSHIP IN CORPORATE SUSTAINABILITY BY GLOBAL ENVIRONMENTAL NON-PROFIT CDP, SECURING A PLACE ON ITS PRESTIGIOUS ‘A LIST' FOR TACKLING CLIMATE CHANGE. WASTE MANAGEMENT WAS RECOGNIZED FOR ITS ACTIONS TO CUT EMISSIONS, MITIGATE CLIMATE RISKS AND DEVELOP THE LOW-CARBON ECONOMY, BASED ON THE DATA REPORTED BY THE COMPANY THROUGH CDP'S 2020 CLIMATE CHANGE QUESTIONNAIRE. “WASTE MANAGEMENT IS VERY PLEASED TO BE LISTED ON CDP'S A LIST"}